oid accidents, all while managing multiple lanes of traffic at once.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235340/extras/7e0cee548c78a589073bac1e7f8525f2.poster.avif?t=1704295118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235340/extras/7e0cee548c78a589073bac1e7f8525f2.webm?t=1704295118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235340/extras/7e0cee548c78a589073bac1e7f8525f2.mp4?t=1704295118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Your Friends and Family</h2><br>Enjoy the game with up to four players in local co-op mode. With easy-to-learn gameplay and intuitive controls, Urban Flow is the perfect game to enjoy with friends and family, both young and old. So gather around and experience the fun and excitement of managing the flow of traffic together! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235340/extras/c800c43888ff678b7fd2be82e53944f8.avif?t=1704295118\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "Control the city's streets and keep the cars moving in perfect harmony in Urban Flow. Navigate complex intersections and avoid accidents as you progress through increasingly challenging levels. Play with up to four players in local co-op mode for added fun with family and friends.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish",
    "reviews": "\u201cThere\u2019s no denying that Urban Flow succeeds at being a highly addictive casual game.\u201d<br>A- \u2013 Gaming Age<br><br>\u201cUrban Flow is the best kind of puzzle game: one that is easy to pick up, difficult to master, and lovingly developed ...\u201d<br>8.8/10 \u2013 Gaming Nexus<br><br>\u201cUrban Flow is a neat game that\u2019s highly enjoyable on your own or with others. Its simple premise is used to great effect forming an experience that\u2019s challenging, frantic but always rewarding.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Nintendo Insider<br>",
